{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fLmP7Vl60R1794402575.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本首相高市早苗，下周將出席在深圳舉行的亞太經合組織(APEC)領導人非正式會議。在外交部例行記者會上，有傳媒提問，中方領導人會否在會議期間與高市早苗會晤。發言人表示，中方已多次就中日關係闡明立場。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆表示：「作為2026年APEC東道主，中方積極履行東道主義務，願同各方一道共同推動APEC中國年，取得圓滿成功。關於中日關係中方已經多次闡明立場。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:39:38.059871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T21:38:11.661760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:33:00.599745+00:00","content_hash":"b62d47c2363825b6c8733652e5d49d554c29b75afc4f5be91e3bf811030a4972","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}